# Multi-objective (total) rewards on an imported model, with the sparse engine.
# For models built from imported files, reward matrices could contain entries for choices
# removed from the (filtered) transition matrix, causing out-of-bounds memory writes
# when building sparse matrices (seen as crashes, typically later and elsewhere).
# The model is multi-lp-rmin-positive-ec.prism, exported in .pexp format.

-importmodel multi-sparse-import-rewards.pexp multi-lp-rmin-positive-ec.prism.props -s
-importmodel multi-sparse-import-rewards.pexp multi-lp-rmin-positive-ec.prism.props -s -lp
-importmodel multi-sparse-import-rewards.pexp multi-lp-rmin-positive-ec.prism.props -s -gs
